WEBVTT

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.936
What data and observations
did you filter in

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.016
as a result of your beliefs,

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.376
and why?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.160
Are your assumptions valid
and supported by facts?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.056
Would a different set of assumptions
create different feelings,

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.520
and result in new and better
conclusions and actions?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.176
We all have our own unique ladder.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.576
Be mindful of yours,

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.560
and help others to see theirs.